</given-names></name><name><surname>Wessel</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Gahr</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><article-title>Kawasaki-Syndrom. Assoziation mit dem Eposition von Teppishshampoo und erfolgeiche Therapie mit Immunglobulinen in der zweiten Krankheitwoche</article-title><source>Monatsschr Kinderheilkd</source><year>1992</year><volume>140</volume><fpage>273</fpage><lpage>76</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1614454</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Asano</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sasaki</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Yashiro</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hatori</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Kuwabara</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Hamada</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Imai</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fujino</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><article-title>Acute panceatitis with Kawasaki disease: analysis of cases with elevated serum amylase levels</article-title><source>Eur J Pediatr</source><year>2005</year><volume>164</volume><fpage>180</fpage><lpage>181</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s00431-004-1589-4</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15717180</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Kushner</surname><given-names>HI</given-names></name><name><surname>Bastian</surname><given-names>JF</given-names></name><name><surname>Turner</surname><given-names>CH</given-names></name><name><surname>Burns</surname><given-names>JC</given-names></name><article-title>Rethinking the boundaries of Kawasaki disease: toward a revised case definition</article-title><source>Perspect Biol Med</source><year>2003</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>216</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type=